From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Flysoft <flysoftbeta@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:46:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] prts: remote windows maximized and frameless; runtime
 viewport from the viewer

Remote mode: browser windows show maximized with no caption buttons, resize
border or non-client hit areas. SetViewport over Mojo updates the headless
screen (ScreenWinHeadless::SetPrimaryDisplayGeometry) and re-maximizes the
registered browser windows.

Patch-Name: 15-remote-window

